summary: spam cpu online/offline events to test for regression
description: |
    This is a regression test for bz1904593. It rapidly offlines and onlines a cpu
    while setting its affinity. If the affinity is set too quickly after the cpu
    comes online it can fail. This tests for a regression of the issue.
contact: Waylon Cude <wcude@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - gcc
  - glibc
recommend:
  - libudev-devel
duration: 30m
extra-summary: /kernel/general/scheduler/1904593-cpu-online-uevent
extra-task: /kernel/general/scheduler/1904593-cpu-online-uevent
